53
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:07,100
At market tops, traders get greedy.

54
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:11,920
At market bottoms, traders get scared. Both sentiments lead to market extremes.

55
00:03:12,020 --> 00:03:13,509
